		</li><li id="text-3" class="widget-container widget_text"><h3 class="widget-title">ROBLOX in the News</h3>			<div class="textwidget"><a href="http://pressroblox.wordpress.com/">ROBLOX Press Blog</a></div>
		</li><li id="rss-2" class="widget-container widget_rss"><h3 class="widget-title"><a class='rsswidget' href='http://blog.roblox.com/?feed=rss2' title='Syndicate this content'><img style='background:orange;color:white;border:none;' width='14' height='14' src='http://s.wordpress.com/wp-includes/images/rss.png' alt='RSS' /></a> <a class='rsswidget' href='http://blog.roblox.com' title='The Roblog'>ROBLOX Developers Journal</a></h3><ul><li><a class='rsswidget' href='http://blog.roblox.com/?p=5911' title=''>The Gift of ROBLOX</a><div class='rssSummary'>We’re pleased to announce ROBLOX Gift Cards, perfect for giving the gift of ROBLOX! These printable gift cards come with a PIN that can be redeemed for ROBLOX Credit. The PIN can be applied to any ROBLOX account. Here’s how… Go to the Gift Card page. Select the desired product. If the player already has [...]</div></li><li><a class='rsswidget' href='http://blog.roblox.com/?p=6091' title=''>Black Friday Hat Sale – Vote for your favorites!</a><div class='rssSummary'>We asked what you wanted to see in our Black Friday 2011 sale – and the results are in! We’ve taken the top 3 items for each category and included them in the poll below, and now it’s up to YOU to make the final decision. Please take the below poll to let us know [...]</div></li></ul></li>			</ul>
